Things are not the
same as a bond!

00:19:05.511 --> 00:19:06.671
Tokio...

00:19:32.037 --> 00:19:33.095
Let's go!

00:19:33.205 --> 00:19:34.035
Raaja!

00:19:35.741 --> 00:19:37.140
Now, hurry!

00:19:38.143 --> 00:19:39.411
