in the immediate area.

00:22:11.363 --> 00:22:14.799
As such, we request the Ministry
surveys the area right away.

00:22:17.002 --> 00:22:21.573
Yes, our firm's announcements
in the past have been false.

00:22:21.573 --> 00:22:25.441
I will be providing you with
detailed documents soon.

